@div kirugu C

A.C.8. ši-im-dirig-ge-en lugal-ŋu₁₀ ši-im-dirig-ge-en ne-zu an-zag-še₃
#lem: dirig[make more than]; lugal[king]; dirig[make more than]; ne[strength]; anzag[horizon]
#tr.en: You are superlative, my master, you are superlative! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.8

A.C.9. en {d}lugal-er₉-ra ši-im-dirig-ge-en ne-zu an-zag-še₃
#lem: en[lord]; Lugalerra[1]; dirig[make more than]; ne[strength]; anzag[horizon]
#tr.en: Your power reaches to the outer limits of heaven. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.9

A.C.10. me-zu me galam-ma me nu-sig₁₀-ge₅-da
#lem: me[Being]; me[Being]; galam[skilful]; me[Being]; sig[put into]
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Lugal-era}, you are superlative, your power reaches to the outer limits of heaven. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.10

A.C.11. ab ku-kur ŋal₂-la ni₂ huš ri-a-me-en
#lem: ab[sea]; kurku[flood]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]; ni[fear]; huš[reddish]; ri[impose]
#tr.en: Your divine powers are artfully fashioned divine powers, incomparable divine powers! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.11

A.C.12. diŋir er₉ kalam-ma til₃-la-me-en
#lem: diŋir[deity]; ir[mighty]; kalam[the Land (of Sumer)]; til[live (of a single person)]
#tr.en: Sea with high waves, you are imbued with terrible fearsomeness! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.12

A.C.13. ni₂ gal an ki-a dul-la-me-en
#lem: ni[fear]; gal[big]; an[sky]; ki[place]; dul[cover]
#tr.en: Mighty god who dwells in the Land, your great awesomeness covers heaven and earth! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.C.13

